{title: 416 ¡Oh!, tenga yo la ardiente fe}
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{lyricist: William H. Bathurst, 1830 (1796-1877); Vers; esp.: Edgar; L; Maxwell (1878-1940); 1 a; u u; I; u u}
{composer: NoRTHFIELD; Jeremiah lngalls (1764-1828); a; a q~}
